 "marks": [
  {
   "d": "2021-11-04",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Notwithstanding evolving pandemic and macro supply chain factors, the business continues to trade in line with market expectations.",
   "file": "20211104_GATC_Preliminary-Results-for-the-year-ended-31-July-21.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-01-18",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -3,
   "q": "Following a review by the Board of the outlook for the business for its financial year ending 31 July 2022 (\"FY22\"), it now anticipates the Company's continuing underlying profit before tax will be significantly below market expectations.",
   "file": "20220118_GATC_Trading-Update.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-03-31",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We expect continuing underlying profit before tax for its financial year ending 31 July 2022 to be around breakeven as announced in January 2022.",
   "file": "20220331_GATC_Interim-Results.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-08-17",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY22",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "We expect our continuing underlying PBT for the full year to be in line with market consensus of break even",
   "file": "20220817_GATC_Trading-Update.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2022-11-03",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Our expectations for FY23 remain unchanged at underlying profit before tax of £2.5m for the year.",
   "file": "20221103_GATC_Preliminary-Results-for-the-year-ended-31-July-22.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-02-15",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "As we enter the second half, we are conscious of softening in some external sectors, and perm is likely to be impacted by a level of restraint around hiring, shifting candidate sentiment and, as such, slightly longer hiring cycles.",
   "file": "20230215_GATC_Trading-Statement.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-03-30",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "Looking forward there remains a high level of macro-economic uncertainty; however, we continue to see good levels of vacancies in the STEM markets that we support, which, when combined with talent shortages, drives demand.",
   "file": "20230330_GATC_Interim-results.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-08-16",
   "doc": "YE-TU",
   "fy": "FY23",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 1,
   "q": "The Group expects to report continuing underlying PBT of £2.5m for FY23, ahead of expectations as a result of the Group's cost rebalancing programme and exit from low margin contracts",
   "file": "20230816_GATC_Trading-Update.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2023-10-24",
   "doc": "FY R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": -1,
   "q": "We are seeing permanent recruitment remaining subdued and are increasing our focus on contractor growth, which takes longer to reflect in NFI, as such we expect profitability will be weighted to second half of the year.",
   "file": "20231024_GATC_Final-results-for-the-year-ended-31-July-2023.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-02-15",
   "doc": "H1 TU",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "flat",
   "s": 0,
   "q": "Despite the tough market conditions, I am pleased to report the Group is trading in line with current market expectations.",
   "file": "20240215_GATC_Trading-Update.md",
   "gnote": "drift §3"
  },
  {
   "d": "2024-04-16",
   "doc": "H1 R",
   "fy": "FY24",
   "g": "CUT",
   "s": -2,
